WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:23.064
Cat ran across the Throne Room.

2
00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:28.704
"A cat!" shrieked the queen. "Ah-choo!"

3
00:00:28.705 --> 00:00:32.981
She was still sneezing. "Ah-choo!"

4
00:00:32.982 --> 00:00:38.014
"Oops," Tom whispered.

5
00:00:38.015 --> 00:00:43.757
Dirk stepped closer to Tom.

6
00:00:43.758 --> 00:00:46.261
He laughed in Tom's ear.

7
00:00:46.262 --> 00:00:51.060
"No cats in the palace, you fool!" he said.

8
00:00:51.061 --> 00:00:56.737
"They make the queen sneeze."

9
00:00:56.738 --> 00:01:00.840
"Ah-ah-ah-CHOO!"

10
00:01:00.841 --> 00:01:04.650
The queen sneezed again.

11
00:01:04.651 --> 00:01:17.370
Honk! She blew her nose loudly.

12
00:01:17.371 --> 00:01:20.767
"Guards!" shouted the king.

13
00:01:20.768 --> 00:01:23.743
He pointed to Tom.

14
00:01:23.744 --> 00:01:28.750
"Seize this wizard at once!"

15
00:01:28.751 --> 00:01:37.718
The guards rushed toward Tom and grabbed him.

16
00:01:37.719 --> 00:01:41.697
"I'm sorry," Tom tried to explain.

17
00:01:41.698 --> 00:01:44.642
"I didn't know the rule. I just—"

18
00:01:44.643 --> 00:01:52.091
"Silence!" Dirk cut Tom off.

19
00:01:52.092 --> 00:01:56.937
Then Dirk turned to the guards.

20
00:01:56.938 --> 00:02:02.653
"Throw that wizard in the Grim Dungeon!"

21
00:02:02.654 --> 00:02:08.881
"The Grim Dungeon!" Tom thought.

22
00:02:08.882 --> 00:02:14.619
"Oh no! That sounds horrible!"

23
00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:17.439
He looked around in a panic.

24
00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:23.083
"Where's Cat?" Tom thought.

25
00:02:23.084 --> 00:02:28.043
"I'll be locked up forever in the Grim Dungeon.

26
00:02:28.044 --> 00:02:32.671
I'll never see her again!"

27
00:02:32.672 --> 00:02:35.701
"Come with us, Wizard!" a guard growled.

28
00:02:35.702 --> 00:02:41.364
They dragged Tom toward the doors.

29
00:02:41.365 --> 00:02:44.653
Dirk bowed low before the king and queen.

30
00:02:44.654 --> 00:02:50.309
"Your Majesties, the tryouts are over now."

31
00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:57.204
Dirk hid his smile as he looked at Ann.

32
00:02:57.205 --> 00:03:00.248
"It's time to name the new royal—"

33
00:03:00.249 --> 00:03:03.495
Just then a voice rang out.

34
00:03:03.496 --> 00:03:10.553
"Wait!" someone shouted.
